  "title": "Extending the bank: Key drivers, technologies and steps",
  "summary": "What does it mean to extend the bank? Traditionally, banks have manufactured, distributed and managed all of their own products and services. The concept of extend describes how this traditional model is changing as the value chain becomes unbundled, the bank ecosystem expands, and other parties become involved in these activities either in collaboration or competition with the bank.",
